*With a [[Waterbirth Island]] or [[Lunar Isle]] POH portal, a [[Divine rune pouch]] can hold runes for [[High alchemy]] and teleports to and from Basilisk Knights all in one inventory slot
* When killed, a Basilisk Knight will always drop Big bones, which can be converted into peaches with the Bones to Peaches spell or [[bones to peaches (tablet)|bones to peaches tablet]]. Peaches heal for 8 health each, meaning that trips can be extended drastically when doing sufficient kills.

